      {
        "id": 19528,
        "name": "The Girl With No Name",
        "username": "The_Girl_With_No_Nam",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/71e660/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-11-05T16:13:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Consider this a cautionary tale from a less experienced table.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Just won a game with&nbsp;Green, Ocean, and Lightning, *barely* taking it thanks to Fear... and then we happened to read Indomitable Claim.</p>\n<p>See, the whole time, we thought&nbsp;that Boon of Proliferation from Green meant you could add a Presence anywhere in range. It wasn’t until we saw Claim that we realised a key area we’d been holding thanks to Ocean... had been illegal the entire game. So even though we got a very tense win, we’re all feeling rather deflated...</p>\n<p>Be careful with Ocean! It’s weird! And, additionally, has this kind of&nbsp;“accidental cheating” ever happened to you?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:14.624Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 4,
        "reads": 1,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 20.2,
